type: dataset
title: "A Conversation with Machiavelli: Guicciardini's Considerazioni on the Discorsi"
abstract: >-
  A free, bilingual, hyperlinked edition of Francesco Guicciardini's
  Considerazioni sui Discorsi del Machiavelli and the chapters of Machiavelli's
  Discorsi they answer. The Italian is established from named public-domain
  witnesses; the English is an AI-assisted translation edited by David
  McDougall.
